WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.205 --> 00:00:02.669
- I was like trying to put this binder on

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:04.919
in the bathroom at work and it just stuck.

00:00:04.919 --> 00:00:05.752
Like this.

00:00:06.737 --> 00:00:08.110
Straight up.

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:09.680
I was like, just trapped.

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:13.013
(acoustic guitar music)

00:00:14.224 --> 00:00:17.423
- A binder is like a chest compressor

00:00:17.423 --> 00:00:20.796
that sort of just
compacts everything down.

00:00:20.796 --> 00:00:23.968
- So I remember being anxious,
but also really excited,

00:00:23.968 --> 00:00:26.761
because I wasn't really
comfortable wearing like

00:00:26.761 --> 00:00:29.343
you know, white tees, or certain shirts

00:00:29.343 --> 00:00:32.388
because it would show my
chest before top surgery,

00:00:32.388 --> 00:00:33.956
and that caused a lot of anxiety.

00:00:33.956 --> 00:00:36.626
- Putting it over my
head and my friend said

00:00:36.626 --> 00:00:38.522
be careful, cause you will get stuck.

00:00:38.522 --> 00:00:40.378
- I got really stuck.

00:00:40.378 --> 00:00:43.165
And then I was like in some
position like (groaning)

00:00:43.165 --> 00:00:44.695
and I like couldn't get an arm,

00:00:44.695 --> 00:00:47.485
and it was very uncomfortable.

00:00:47.485 --> 00:00:49.661
- First off, I had gotten the wrong size.

00:00:49.661 --> 00:00:50.561
Way too small.

00:00:50.561 --> 00:00:53.736
I didn't know how to put it
on, I didn't really understand

00:00:53.736 --> 00:00:56.938
how one is supposed to
get into this armor.

00:00:56.938 --> 00:00:58.625
- It all felt like
everything had just bunched

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:01.170
in the middle, and then
I couldn't breathe.

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:04.403
- Some binders will push
all of your fat down

00:01:04.403 --> 00:01:06.010
into your belly.

00:01:06.010 --> 00:01:10.315
And then so you'll have
this like giant spare tire.

00:01:10.315 --> 00:01:13.634
- The first time I went
outside, I felt so happy,

00:01:13.634 --> 00:01:16.140
because I looked down at
my chest and I feel like

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:18.840
yes, this is what I want,
this is what I've wanted.

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:21.961
- Oh my god, like, I don't
have, like boobs right now.

00:01:21.961 --> 00:01:23.652
This is amazing.

00:01:23.652 --> 00:01:24.889
- The way people would see me

00:01:24.889 --> 00:01:26.650
was the way I wanted to be seen.

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:30.222
- It felt hot, I felt all the good things.

00:01:30.222 --> 00:01:32.429
- And then once I was
ready to take it off,

00:01:32.429 --> 00:01:35.458
I got super scared, because
that is also very difficult.

00:01:35.458 --> 00:01:37.962
- My girlfriend helped
me get it over my head

00:01:37.962 --> 00:01:39.769
so I wouldn't get stuck again.

00:01:39.769 --> 00:01:42.635
- If you're gonna do it,
definitely go to a binding,

00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:44.152
a company that makes binders.

00:01:44.152 --> 00:01:46.360
No ace bandages or anything like that.

00:01:46.360 --> 00:01:48.193
- Don't use duct tape.

00:01:49.640 --> 00:01:51.576
Unless you want your skin to rip off,

00:01:51.576 --> 00:01:54.199
oh my god don't use duct tape please.

00:01:54.199 --> 00:01:57.093
- Find community, where
you feel comfortable

00:01:57.093 --> 00:01:58.858
and safe talking about it.

00:01:58.858 --> 00:02:02.402
Whether that's in person or online.

00:02:02.402 --> 00:02:05.735
(acoustic guitar music)

